#: src/meridiana/energy/consumption.py:357
msgid "The typical profile gives the weight w of each hour (weekday, Saturday, Sunday and holiday, month); the designer's kWh are spread on those weights within each group, so every group keeps its kWh. Bands as in ARERA's table."
