#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:202
msgid "Energy balance and economics"
msgstr "Bilancio energetico ed economico"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:209
msgid "Hourly balance"
msgstr "Bilancio orario"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:211
msgid "Every hour the production first covers the consumption; what is left is fed into the grid, what is missing is taken from it. Hours in Italian local time, bands as ARERA's table."
msgstr "Ogni ora la produzione copre prima i consumi; quello che avanza va in rete, quello che manca si preleva dalla rete. Ore in ora locale italiana, fasce come nella tabella ARERA."

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:213
msgid "production, first year"
msgstr "produzione, primo anno"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:214
msgid "consumption"
msgstr "consumi"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:215
msgid "energy self-consumed"
msgstr "energia autoconsumata"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:219 src/meridiana/ui/energy_pages.py:657 src/meridiana/ui/energy_pages.py:738
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "Accumulo"

#: src/meridiana/energy/economics.py:222
msgid "The surplus of each hour charges the battery, the shortfall discharges it, within its usable energy and its power; the round-trip efficiency is split half in and half out. The battery starts empty and does not charge from the grid."
msgstr "Il surplus di ogni ora carica la batteria, l'ammanco la scarica, entro la sua energia utilizzabile e la sua potenza; il rendimento di ciclo si divide a metà tra carica e scarica. La batteria parte scarica e non si carica dalla rete."

